    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Proposing another time politely",
     "texto": [
      "To change an appointment, briefly explain the reason and propose an alternative: **Jeg må endre avtalen på grunn av jobb. Passer torsdag i stedet?** («I have to change the appointment because of work. Does Thursday suit you instead?»). **Dessverre** softens the news, and **ledig** lets you ask about availability.",
      "When the new time is agreed, you can repeat it to confirm: **Da sees vi torsdag klokka tre** («Then we'll see each other on Thursday at three»). In this use, **passer** means «to suit» or «to be convenient»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
